                                                "sense_id": "1a5efd81-8ad6-3654-bd4d-7c5fc08650e9",
                                                "text": "You can win games in two ways. You either outtalent and outmuscle your opponent because you have all the big, fast studs, or you outfox, outplot, and outmaneuver your opponent because you have a system that your opponents can't prepare for in one week."
